window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/c358-680e22bf2991aa3a.json"]={sha256:"680e22bf2991aa3a49b06ca9b421e85568f80938609284bde7775bf038b5bb30",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v24-case-6d6c5f9590a03bf4","url":"https://science.nasa.gov/mission/mars-2020-perseverance/ingenuity-mars-helicopter/","title":"Ingenuity Mars helicopter — NASA Science","titleEn":"Ingenuity Mars helicopter — NASA Science","publisher":"NASA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"c358","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"c358","related":[{"id":"c359","referenceUrls":["https://science.nasa.gov/mission/insight/"],"title":"InSight 火星地球物理站","titleEn":"InSight Mars geophysical station","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：理想值僅作下界；若教學供電上限 80 W，低密度情境在尚未計入損失前已不合格。 每項結論須附輸入、單位、版本與未解限制。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Treat the result only as a lower bound; with an 80 W teaching supply limit, the low-density case already fails before losses. Attach inputs, units, revision and unresolved limitations to each conclusion.","difference":"以 S−P 到時差估算簡化距離，分辨單一事件定位與速度模型假設。","differenceEn":"Estimate a simplified distance from S−P arrival time while distinguishing event location from velocity-model assumptions.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。合成重量 W=6 N、大氣密度 ρ=0.02 kg/m³、有效盤面 A=1 m²；盤面不重複加算。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：Pi=6^1.5/sqrt(2×0.02×1)。 結果約 73.4847 W。理想懸停 Pi=W^(3/2)/sqrt(2ρA)；不含槳剖面阻力、機械損失與非均勻入流。","以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。合成 P 波速 6 km/s、S 波速 3.5 km/s，到時差 50 s。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：d=50/(1/3.5−1/6)。 結果約 420 km。均勻直線路徑下 Δt=d(1/vS−1/vP)；分層行星、反射相與誤認相不適用。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Use synthetic W=6 N, density 0.02 kg/m³ and effective disk area 1 m² without double-counting overlapping disks. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: Pi=6^1.5/sqrt(2×0.02×1). Result ≈ 73.4847 W. Ideal hover Pi=W^(3/2)/sqrt(2ρA), excluding profile drag, mechanical loss and nonuniform inflow.","All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Synthetic P speed is 6 km/s, S speed 3.5 km/s and arrival difference 50 s. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: d=50/(1/3.5−1/6). Result ≈ 420 km. For a uniform straight path, Δt=d(1/vS−1/vP); layered structure, reflected phases and misidentification violate the model.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"c368","referenceUrls":["https://science.nasa.gov/mission/lucy/"],"title":"Lucy 特洛伊小行星探測","titleEn":"Lucy Trojan-asteroid mission","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：理想值僅作下界；若教學供電上限 80 W，低密度情境在尚未計入損失前已不合格。 每項結論須附輸入、單位、版本與未解限制。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Treat the result only as a lower bound; with an 80 W teaching supply limit, the low-density case already fails before losses. Attach inputs, units, revision and unresolved limitations to each conclusion.","difference":"以最近接距離與橫向速度估算影像追蹤角速率。","differenceEn":"Estimate image tracking angular rate from closest-approach distance and transverse speed.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。合成重量 W=6 N、大氣密度 ρ=0.02 kg/m³、有效盤面 A=1 m²；盤面不重複加算。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：Pi=6^1.5/sqrt(2×0.02×1)。 結果約 73.4847 W。理想懸停 Pi=W^(3/2)/sqrt(2ρA)；不含槳剖面阻力、機械損失與非均勻入流。","以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。合成橫向速度 6 km/s、最近接距離 1000 km。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：ω=(6/1000)×180/π。 結果約 0.343775 deg/s。最近接瞬間 ω≈v⊥/r，為局部小角度模型；離開最近接時需用完整相對向量。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Use synthetic W=6 N, density 0.02 kg/m³ and effective disk area 1 m² without double-counting overlapping disks. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: Pi=6^1.5/sqrt(2×0.02×1). Result ≈ 73.4847 W. Ideal hover Pi=W^(3/2)/sqrt(2ρA), excluding profile drag, mechanical loss and nonuniform inflow.","All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Use synthetic transverse speed 6 km/s and closest approach 1000 km. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: ω=(6/1000)×180/π. Result ≈ 0.343775 deg/s. At closest approach ω≈v⊥/r is a local small-angle model; other times require the full relative vector.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v24-case-6e34d6b4c16ad626","url":"https://science.nasa.gov/mission/insight/","title":"InSight Mars geophysical station — NASA Science","titleEn":"InSight Mars geophysical station — NASA Science","publisher":"NASA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v24-case-b581142d591a0666","url":"https://science.nasa.gov/mission/lucy/","title":"Lucy Trojan-asteroid mission — NASA Science","titleEn":"Lucy Trojan-asteroid mission — NASA Science","publisher":"NASA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
